 3                                                                                                  
.MAX IT                                                                                             
60                                                                                                  
.GRADIE                                                                                             
1.0D-7                                                                                              
.ENERGY                                                                                             
1.0D-12                                                                                             
.CONDIT                                                                                             
2                                                                                                   
